Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.30,0:00:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here! 
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,We made it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.64,0:00:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We're already here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.65,0:00:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.90,0:00:32.75,Default,,0,0,0,,How many portals does the Guild have?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.04,0:00:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Every Guild Hall has one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.70,0:00:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,There are some mainly dedicated for teleporting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Around two hundred,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.58,0:00:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,spread across the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.29,0:00:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Wouldn't that make smuggling really easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.12,0:00:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The Guild isn't a human country,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.75,0:00:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,so smuggling isn't really a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't do anything illegal\Nto disrupt supply and demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.58,0:00:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you guys count as foreigners?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.83,0:00:54.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The Guild has people from every country.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.29,0:00:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We also have our own special ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.42,0:00:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It allows us live normally in sixty-some countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.64,0:01:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who choose to live at the guild instead
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.42,0:01:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,get their own ID cards as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.63,0:01:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So spirits get them too!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.33,0:01:08.75,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as no one objects,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.08,0:01:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,the Guild follows regional laws as much as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.71,0:01:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It helps avoid any conflict. 
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.79,0:01:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know any of this, Gen?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.40,0:01:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.67,0:01:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a super pretty girl over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.69,0:01:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.84,0:01:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Spirits really are something else...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.18,0:01:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's endless!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.46,0:01:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Aside from this building,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.52,0:01:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,the rest of the space is one big body of water.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.79,0:01:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Longyou Guild is like a water planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.42,0:01:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's 99% water.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.38,0:01:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Below this building
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.79,0:01:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,is the main part of Longyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.25,0:02:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It has more aquatic spirits than any other Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.12,0:02:03.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But their hall manager can't swim.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.66,0:02:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.46,0:02:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like an underwater level down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.45,0:02:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.54,0:02:19.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go down today?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.21,0:02:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.21,0:02:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The lower levels are closed today for setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.25,0:02:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Only the upper level is open.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.08,0:02:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's explore Longyou City!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.70,0:02:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.21,0:02:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the hall manager of Lingxi Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.75,0:02:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I go get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.50,0:02:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.46,0:02:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He comes here a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.29,0:02:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's our hall manager's drinking buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.29,0:02:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He's probably just wandering around.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.67,0:02:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Just keep it in mind next time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.78,0:02:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.75,0:02:47.91,Default,,0,0,0,,There are hall managers like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.33,0:02:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That spirit is super spirit-y.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.44,0:02:58.33,Default,,0,0,0,,True, true!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.88,0:03:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, they {\i1}are{\i0} a spirit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.67,0:03:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I've seen that person before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.39,0:03:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.96,0:03:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The person I ran into before...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.58,0:03:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That was you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.44,0:03:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.25,0:03:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.33,0:03:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to fighting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.03,0:03:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Zhang.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.45,0:03:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You know each other?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.25,0:03:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We ran into each other in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.71,0:03:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what he looks like in real life?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.83,0:03:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Longyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.88,0:03:39.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Placed fifth in the last martial arts tournament.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.13,0:03:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He's one of the eight seeded contestants this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.83,0:03:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,In a few years, the tournament should get even livelier.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.67,0:03:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.71,0:03:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Because of All Living Beings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.00,0:03:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,In just this one month,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.17,0:03:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,we've found hundreds of people with talent worth training.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.75,0:03:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,No era has ever\Nbeen able to, like now,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.00,0:03:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,test hundreds of millions of people at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.46,0:04:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,With a base that large,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.04,0:04:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,even one in a few hundred thousand\Nstill adds up to hundreds.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.50,0:04:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that why you made the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.67,0:04:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.37,0:04:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Humans can only go so far in training.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.25,0:04:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So finding their talent\Nfor it isn't the main point.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.63,0:04:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But many people without the constitution for training
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.04,0:04:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,turn out to be surprisingly good at using abilities.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.46,0:04:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,For spirits,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.79,0:04:23.63,Default,,0,0,0,,the game is a rare training ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.88,0:04:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,In the future, the way training works
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.25,0:04:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,is going to change completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.46,0:04:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a good thing or a bad thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.58,0:04:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.75,0:04:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So we'll have to keep a close eye on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.79,0:04:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like exploring uncharted territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.58,0:04:37.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.71,0:04:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,This passage is a fixed link.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.92,0:04:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It connects to Longyou City.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.13,0:04:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you pass through this ring,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.25,0:04:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,you're already in Longyou City.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.08,0:04:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't the ring break?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.79,0:04:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It could.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.29,0:04:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What happens to someone right in the middle?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.21,0:04:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,They'd probably be teleported randomly to one side.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.21,0:04:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.46,0:05:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't linger at the connection point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.67,0:05:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,From here, it’s just a regular office building.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.72,0:05:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.43,0:05:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're really are in another city!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.39,0:05:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.50,0:05:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.83,0:05:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Fengxi Park!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.29,0:05:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so close!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.67,0:05:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to go see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.46,0:05:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we allowed to just leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.40,0:05:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.50,0:05:29.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xiaohei is the one with a task.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.33,0:05:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just here to sightsee.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.18,0:05:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.87,0:05:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.04,0:05:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.00,0:05:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Lunch is on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.93,0:05:50.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So he's Lord Wuxian's disciple.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.81,0:05:51.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.96,0:05:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Learning to judge your opponent's strength\Nis important too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.83,0:05:58.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Master, you think I can't beat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.83,0:05:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yan...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.67,0:06:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep your voice down.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.75,0:06:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I can't beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.83,0:06:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Only once you surpass me, \Nmay you challenge him.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.79,0:06:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.71,0:06:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Good boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.21,0:06:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,His master would never let him enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.08,0:06:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.71,0:06:19.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Win this year's championship first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.75,0:06:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Understood, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.71,0:06:30.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Here you go, little one.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.21,0:06:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,So many people!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.08,0:06:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Longyou City's most famous landmark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.46,0:06:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I know, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.63,0:06:41.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They say it suddenly appeared four years ago.\NThe Tree from Beyond the Sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.67,0:06:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hall Manager, did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.75,0:06:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Not me. Someone much stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.33,0:06:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.55,0:06:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know when it appeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.62,0:06:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.84,0:07:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.33,0:07:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's even bigger up close!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.67,0:07:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,It's completely merged with the buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.71,0:07:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there a giant forest like this here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.29,0:07:18.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.08,0:07:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It spread underground and grew up from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.90,0:07:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,So cool...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.75,0:07:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,The Guild bought these buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.17,0:07:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,After reinforcing the damaged structures,\Nthey turned them into observation towers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.71,0:07:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you been back since?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.38,0:07:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Want to go up and see?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.92,0:07:47.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.71,0:07:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.42,0:07:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.46,0:07:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,This one's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.17,0:08:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, the kitty's eating ice cream!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.92,0:08:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the roof!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.33,0:08:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so big!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.79,0:08:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom, look over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,My turn, my turn!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.92,0:08:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is all one tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.21,0:08:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the park's top level.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.83,0:08:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't go up any higher?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Up there is a restricted area.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.96,0:08:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Only staff can go up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.92,0:08:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then are we...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.58,0:08:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Staff, obviously!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.92,0:09:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.92,0:09:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a spirit up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.83,0:09:14.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it staff?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.42,0:09:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.38,0:09:16.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not good at sensing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.00,0:09:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't even tell there was a spirit up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.14,0:09:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.00,0:09:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,many spirits have come to Longyou these past few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.08,0:09:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It's normal for a few to be sightseeing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.13,0:09:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an open rooftop.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.79,0:09:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.88,0:09:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's off-limits.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.29,0:10:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay safe, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.51,0:10:00.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.50,0:10:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't they build a walkway?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.63,0:10:05.83,Default,,0,0,0,,The Guild says nothing can be built on the tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It'd get in the way of its growth.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.71,0:10:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it still growing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.83,0:10:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it knock the buildings down someday?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.79,0:10:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a team monitoring it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.21,0:10:15.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.75,0:10:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Kali!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.23,0:10:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaoshi?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.00,0:10:19.25,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.71,0:10:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go say hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.29,0:10:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,So high up...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.08,0:10:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,So scary...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.58,0:10:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to head over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.42,0:10:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.38,0:10:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,From here?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.29,0:10:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I can handle things here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.13,0:10:39.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.17,0:10:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just looking makes my legs shake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.13,0:10:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei's just like he is in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.17,0:10:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think someone might\Nbring that game feeling out with them
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.92,0:10:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and just jump off?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.46,0:10:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.96,0:11:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,The game and reality feel very different.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.58,0:11:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's probably part of why play time is limited.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.67,0:11:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.17,0:11:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.19,0:12:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.29,0:12:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you staff?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.92,0:12:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not stuck up here, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.50,0:12:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you need help?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.50,0:12:40.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming over!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.37,0:13:01.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiaohei...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.08,0:13:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You've gotten so strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.26,0:13:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Luozhu...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.23,0:13:21.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.75,0:13:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,One more!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.88,0:13:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Three, two, one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.64,0:13:28.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheese!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.79,0:13:42.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.08,0:13:49.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you here to keep Fengxi company?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.34,0:13:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I work part-time at a flower shop nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.87,0:13:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm not busy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:56.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.87,0:13:58.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it close?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.13,0:14:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.54,0:14:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A little over two years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.33,0:14:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's Tianhu?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.42,0:14:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still kept at the Guild.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.88,0:14:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know where I was?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.79,0:14:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.46,0:14:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you come find me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.67,0:14:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't hate you, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.66,0:14:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I've missed you a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I come visit you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.54,0:14:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.71,0:14:57.17,Default,,0,0,0,,come see you, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.50,0:14:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.00,0:15:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry, Lord Wuxian.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.50,0:15:13.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Luozhu was cleared by the Telepathy Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.46,0:15:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's no danger to Xiaohei.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.63,0:15:16.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.29,0:15:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.54,0:15:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Go get him.
